TODO-*.md

# Local-only practice work. Removed from the repo in abb235d and kept on disk.
# Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: a bare `leetcode/` would match a
# directory of that name at ANY depth, which is exactly the trap `resume/` on
# line 56 fell into (it silently hid src/app/resume/ from Tailwind's scanner
# and shipped the About page without its CSS).
/leetcode/

# ---- Local-only working material ----
# None of this is part of the website. Kept on disk, out of the repo.
# Anchored with a leading slash so a directory of the same name nested under
# src/ can never be swallowed (see /leetcode/ above for why that matters).
/PORTFOLIO.md
/HERO_IMAGE_PROMPTS.md
/REDESIGN_PROMPT.md
/docs/audits/
/docs/superpowers/
/codeforces/
/sync/

